# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# JobAI Frontend — Mode 4: SEPARATED (production, different servers)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Frontend deployed to Vercel/Netlify/Render static site.
# Backend deployed to its own Render/Railway/VPS service.
#
# Replace the URL below with your actual backend domain.
#
# Build:  cp frontend/.env.mode4 frontend/.env.production
#         # Edit VITE_API_URL below first!
#         npm run build
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ← CHANGE THIS to your backend's public URL
VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api
